 - The `users` array contains the current page of results; if there are more users, follow the `Link` response header with `rel="next"`
 
 To change who has access, use `PUT /:account_slug/boards/:board_id` with the `user_ids` parameter.
+
+## Board Publication
+
+Boards are unpublished by default. Board JSON includes `public_url`, which is `null` until the board is published. Once published, it contains the full secret URL for viewing the board without signing in.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only account admins (including owners) with access to the board can publish it; being the board's creator alone is not sufficient. No parameters are required.
+
+Returns `204 No Content`. Fetch the board to retrieve its `public_url`. Publishing an already-published board keeps the same URL.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Requires the same admin permissions as publishing.
+
+Returns `204 No Content`, including when the board is already unpublished. All public board, column, and card URLs stop working immediately, and `public_url` becomes `null`. Publishing the board again generates a new secret URL; old URLs remain invalid.
+
+### Public pages
+
+Anyone with the secret URL can view these read-only HTML pages without authentication:
+
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+Only published cards belonging to the board are accessible. Drafts are never listed or accessible directly. Unknown or revoked keys and cards or columns outside the board return `404 Not Found`. Public access does not grant permission to edit the board or its contents.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9e388f5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,156 @@
+require "test_helper"
+
+class Boards::PublicationsControllerTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
+  setup do
+    sign_in_as :kevin
+    @board = boards(:writebook)
+  end
+
+  test "publish and unpublish as JSON" do
+    get board_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :success
+    assert response.parsed_body.key?("public_url")
+    assert_nil response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    key = @board.publication.key
+
+    get board_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_equal public_board_url(key), response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_equal key, @board.reload.publication.key
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+
+    get board_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_nil response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :no_content
+  end
+
+  test "board lists include public URLs" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    get boards_path, as: :json
+    assert_response :success
+    json = response.parsed_body.index_by { |board| board["id"] }
+    assert_equal public_board_url(@board.publication.key), json.fetch(@board.id)["public_url"]
+    assert_nil json.fetch(boards(:private).id)["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "publishing and unpublishing invalidate cached board JSON" do
+    original_cache_store = Rails.cache
+    Rails.cache = ActiveSupport::Cache::MemoryStore.new
+
+    with_actionview_partial_caching do
+      get board_path(@board), as: :json
+      assert_nil response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+      post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+      get board_path(@board), as: :json
+      assert_equal public_board_url(@board.reload.publication.key), response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+
+      delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+      get board_path(@board), as: :json
+      assert_nil response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+    end
+  ensure
+    Rails.cache = original_cache_store
+  end
+
+  test "embedded board JSON reflects publication changes with caching enabled" do
+    original_cache_store = Rails.cache
+    Rails.cache = ActiveSupport::Cache::MemoryStore.new
+
+    with_actionview_partial_caching do
+      get card_path(cards(:logo)), as: :json
+      assert_nil response.parsed_body["board"]["public_url"]
+
+      post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+      get card_path(cards(:logo)), as: :json
+      assert_equal public_board_url(@board.reload.publication.key), response.parsed_body["board"]["public_url"]
+
+      delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+      get card_path(cards(:logo)), as: :json
+      assert_nil response.parsed_body["board"]["public_url"]
+    end
+  ensure
+    Rails.cache = original_cache_store
+  end
+
+  test "admins see publication controls in board settings" do
+    get edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_select "form[action=?]", board_publication_path(@board)
+  end
+
+  test "non-admin board creators do not see publication controls" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+    get edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_select "form[action=?]", board_publication_path(@board), count: 0
+  end
+
+  test "publish and unpublish from board settings" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board)
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board)
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "board creators who are not admins cannot publish or unpublish" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :david
+    assert_equal users(:david), @board.creator
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+
+    @board.publish
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "owners can publish" do
+    @board.accesses.grant_to users(:jason)
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :jason
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :no_content
+  end
+
+  test "admins cannot publish boards they cannot access" do
+    private_board = Board.create!(name: "Secret", account: @board.account, creator: users(:david), all_access: false)
+
+    post board_publication_path(private_board), as: :json
+    assert_response :not_found
+    assert_not private_board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "admins cannot publish boards from another account" do
+    post board_publication_path(boards(:miltons_wish_list)), as: :json
+    assert_response :not_found
+    assert_not boards(:miltons_wish_list).published?
+  end
+
+  test "anonymous visitors cannot publish or unpublish" do
+    sign_out
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :redirect
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+
+    @board.publish
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+    assert_response :redirect
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+end
